SOURCE_JSON:{"id":"kunwon-busan-original","acquired_at":"2026-10-10T09:25:00.080Z","url":"https://www.kunwon.com/board/perform.read.php?BBS_GUBUN=1&SC_LP=&SC_YEAR=&SC_SUPPLY=&SC_LOCAL=&SC_word=%EB%B6%80%EC%82%B0&page=1&BBS_IDX=32","title":"건원건축","text":"Profile\nProject\nExpertise\nNews\nRecruit\nContact\nLanguage\n\n KTX 부산역사\n\n위치\n부산광역시 동구 초량동\n연도\n1996.09\n규모\nB1, 5FL\n연면적\n44,874.85㎡\n용도\n교통시설\n수상\n부산통합역사 국제설계경기 당선작/ 부산다운 건축상 은상\n\nKTX 부산 통합역사는 비대칭 형태로 열려있는 투명한 유리 입면을 통해 기존 철도부지로 단절되었던 부산항의 수변공간이 도시로 확장되도록 하였다. 이러한 디자인적 상징성과 가시성을 지닌 KTX 부산역사는 부산 광역 교통의 중심지로서, 바다 또는 육로로 부산을 찾는 사람들을 반기고 있다.\n\nList\n건원 전자구매 시스템\n \nENGLISH\n \n中文\n \n건원 엔지니어링\n \n\nCopyright © KUNWON Architects Planners Engineers All rights reserved.","links":[],"images":[{"alt":"","src":"https://www.kunwon.com/board/perform.fileDown.php?BBS_GUBUN=1&SC_LP=&SC_YEAR=&SC_SUPPLY=&SC_LOCAL=&SC_word=%EB%B6%80%EC%82%B0&page=1&code=16202&mode=tn2","w":1200,"h":675},{"alt":"","src":"https://www.kunwon.com/board/perform.fileDown.php?BBS_GUBUN=1&SC_LP=&SC_YEAR=&SC_SUPPLY=&SC_LOCAL=&SC_word=%EB%B6%80%EC%82%B0&page=1&code=16203&mode=tn2","w":1200,"h":675},{"alt":"","src":"https://www.kunwon.com/board/perform.fileDown.php?BBS_GUBUN=1&SC_LP=&SC_YEAR=&SC_SUPPLY=&SC_LOCAL=&SC_word=%EB%B6%80%EC%82%B0&page=1&code=16204&mode=tn2","w":1200,"h":675},{"alt":"","src":"https://www.kunwon.com/board/perform.fileDown.php?BBS_GUBUN=1&SC_LP=&SC_YEAR=&SC_SUPPLY=&SC_LOCAL=&SC_word=%EB%B6%80%EC%82%B0&page=1&code=16205&mode=tn2","w":1200,"h":675},{"alt":"","src":"https://www.kunwon.com/board/perform.fileDown.php?BBS_GUBUN=1&SC_LP=&SC_YEAR=&SC_SUPPLY=&SC_LOCAL=&SC_word=%EB%B6%80%EC%82%B0&page=1&code=16206&mode=tn2","w":1200,"h":675},{"alt":"","src":"https://www.kunwon.com/board/perform.fileDown.php?BBS_GUBUN=1&SC_LP=&SC_YEAR=&SC_SUPPLY=&SC_LOCAL=&SC_word=%EB%B6%80%EC%82%B0&page=1&code=16198&mode=tn2","w":1200,"h":675},{"alt":"","src":"https://www.kunwon.com/board/perform.fileDown.php?BBS_GUBUN=1&SC_LP=&SC_YEAR=&SC_SUPPLY=&SC_LOCAL